// Altars 2011 has and 289 does not (Lumbridge was reworked in July 2008, wiki
// Lumbridge Castle, and later content added its own): every loc void-634
// counts as a prayer altar (its prayer_altar_* in
// data/skill/prayer/altar.objs.toml, which PrayerAltars.kt answers) whose op1
// in the 647 cache is Pray or Pray-at, which is the op [oploc1,_prayer_altar]
// answers.

